# go1.27 Patch CHANGELOG

## Status

Experiment target: **go1.27rc2** (stable go1.27 not yet released). File-based patches only;
legacy `instrument_go` is not used for go1.27+.

Seeded from `patches/go1.26`. Compared anchors against `go-release/go1.27rc2`.

## Patch adjustments from go1.26 to go1.27

### Patches adjusted

- `src/runtime/proc.go.xgo.patch` (`xgo_proc_init_finished`):
  `close(main_init_done)` → `close(mainInitDoneChan)` (go1.27 renames the channel and
  adds `mainInitDone atomic.Bool`).
- `src/cmd/go/internal/test/test.go.xgo.patch` (`xgo_test_unify_pkgs`):
  `moduleLoaderState` → `moduleLoader` (`*modload.Loader` replaces `*modload.State`).
- `src/cmd/go/internal/test/xgo_testunified.go`:
  `xgoModuleLoaderState *modload.State` → `xgoModuleLoader *modload.Loader`;
  `PackagesAndErrors` call updated accordingly.

### Patches unchanged (anchors still match go1.27rc2)

- `src/runtime/{runtime2.go,time.go,xgo_trap.go}`, `src/time/*`, `src/testing/testing.go`
- `src/cmd/compile/internal/{gc/main.go,noder/noder.go}`
- `src/cmd/go/main.go`, `src/cmd/go/internal/work/exec.go`, `src/cmd/go/internal/load/test.go`
- `src/cmd/cover/*`, `src/cmd/internal/test2json/*`
- `src/encoding/json/encode.go` (kept for `//go:build !goexperiment.jsonv2` /
  `GOEXPERIMENT=nojsonv2`; classic `unsupportedTypeEncoder` Path-A hook)

### Loose JSON (json v2 baseline)

go1.27 defaults `GOEXPERIMENT=jsonv2` on, so `encoding/json.Marshal` no longer hits
classic `unsupportedTypeEncoder`. Path-A for unsupported types under
`XgoIsLooseJsonMarshaling` lives on the v2 invalid arshaler:

- **Added** `src/encoding/json/v2/arshal_default.go.xgo.patch`:
  import `runtime` + at start of `makeInvalidArshaler` marshal func write
  `{"Type":"?"}` via `jsontext.Encoder.WriteValue` when loose mode is on.

### Other repo updates

- `support/goinfo/constants.go`: `GO_VERSION_27`
- `instrument/instrument_compiler/patch_noders.go`: upper bound through go1.27
- `instrument/instrument_runtime/template/{func_name.go,defs.go}`: confirmed
  `funcNameForPrint` wrap still present through go1.27
- `patch/legacy/adapter_go1.27.go` added; shared adapter extended to go1.24–go1.27
  (`adapter_go1.24_25_26_27.go`)
- `__config__.json` version bumped to `go1.27+`
- CI: `.github/workflows/go1-27.yml` and `go1-27-fast.yml` (install go1.27rc2 from
  go.dev/dl until stable ships); `go-next.yml` retargeted to go1.28 placeholder
